# PATTERN 2: FAN-OUT / FAN-IN
# Every 13th branch file is "corrupt". Expect Failed = 3 for 50 files (branches 13, 26 and 39),
# each after 3 retry attempts, while the run as a whole still completes.

# URL and keys come from http-client.env.json. Local values are the default; to test the deployed app, choose azure at the top right of this editor.

### Flat fan-out: 50 activities in parallel
# @name flat
POST {{baseUrl}}/rollup
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchCount": 50,
  "batchSize": 0
}

### Result of the flat run
GET {{flat.response.body.$.StatusQueryGetUri}}

### Batched fan-out: 1,000 files as 4 sub-orchestrations of 250
# @name batched
POST {{baseUrl}}/rollup
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchCount": 1000,
  "batchSize": 250
}

### Result of the batched run
GET {{batched.response.body.$.StatusQueryGetUri}}
